  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe Random Category in the Worlds Tab has a Shuffle Button which you can use to get a new set of random Worlds. This Shuffle Button is intractable in all Categories of the Worlds Tab. You still get a hover sound effect, tooltip and the pressing sound effect, the only thing you can't do is see it.\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n1. Open the Worlds Tab in the Main Menu\n2. Go to any Category in it (e.g. Uploaded Worlds)\n3. Move your cursor up / down between the 3 and 4 world in a row\nIf you do this you will notice that you can see the tooltip, etc. for the Shuffle Button.  \nNote: If you have opened the Random Category before doing this, the Button will be at a different height. (It moves higher up after it first loaded in)\n# Expected Behavior:\nThe button is only intractable in the Random Category of the Worlds Tab.\n# Attachments:\nHere is video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/adcver",
